  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:00:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:00:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. [inaudible] Sorry, I think I call wrong number. Can you hear me okay? I am on speakerphone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, but it sounds a little echoey, like you're in a tunnel. Go ahead, what were you looking for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:00:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have old flyer from the city. Maybe from last year. I dial the number on it, and now I get you. I want to ask about my recycling bin, the pickup day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. That flyer number may be out of date. This is the City Clerk, so we don't handle trash and recycling here. You'd want the Department of Public Services. Would you like me to transfer you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:00:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes please. I am sorry for bother you. [line breaks up] Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:00:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother at all. Hold on one moment, and I'll put you through. If the call drops, they're the right department to ask for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:01:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you very much. Public Services. I will throw away the old flyer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:01:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's probably wise. Transferring you now."
    }
  ],
